# Shadowrocket RULE-SET
# Maintained by this repository; policy is assigned by shadowrocket.conf.

# Proxy ACL
# Updated: 2026-09-08
#
# Default traffic policy: proxy.
# Advertising and tracking domains are intentionally not blocked.
# Domain rules are preferred because service IP and CDN ranges change often.
# The proxy_list is retained for ACL client compatibility and documentation.
# 默认代理；未匹配流量也通过代理，广告可以正常加载。
# 常用服务
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,1password.com
